  "id": "https://samsm.ch/portfolio-v/",
  "type": "Article",
  "name": "Portfolio V - 2020",
  "summary": "\u003cp\u003eThis year was, unlike the previous few, without any major travel. Although I did\nmove from the UK to Switzerland, which did give me a new place to explore and\nphotograph. Even with that I took a fraction of the number of photos I usually\ntake in a year in 2020, which left me with not much to choose from for this\nselection. I chose to still put it together though because I like that this has\nbecome somewhat of a yearly reflection (even if it does take me the better part\nof the next year to put them together) and I thought that given it was somewhat\nof an interesting year it could be nice to have this record.\u003c/p\u003e",
  "content": "\u003cp\u003eThis year was, unlike the previous few, without any major travel. Although I did\nmove from the UK to Switzerland, which did give me a new place to explore and\nphotograph. Even with that I took a fraction of the number of photos I usually\ntake in a year in 2020, which left me with not much to choose from for this\nselection. I chose to still put it together though because I like that this has\nbecome somewhat of a yearly reflection (even if it does take me the better part\nof the next year to put them together) and I thought that given it was somewhat\nof an interesting year it could be nice to have this record.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlong with the reduced number of photos taken came a complete lack of work\ntowards any larger serious projects, although I have started a couple of\ncollections of images taken with my phone that could become something\neventually.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/16704/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/16704/16704.avif\"\n         title=\"Grand Union Canal\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking across a canal at the path and hedgerow on the other side, with two small billboards covered in graffiti\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"16704\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eGrand Union Canal\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/16711/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/16711/16711.avif\"\n         title=\"Worcester \u0026amp; Birmingham Canal I\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking down through a tree at a canal and towpath\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"16711\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eWorcester \u0026amp; Birmingham Canal I\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/16712/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/16712/16712.avif\"\n         title=\"Worcester \u0026amp; Birmingham Canal II\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of an old bridge over a narrow canal\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"16712\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eWorcester \u0026amp; Birmingham Canal II\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/16907/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/16907/16907.avif\"\n         title=\"Sihl\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a tall concrete pillar in a river, with a poster of a nature scene near the base\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"16907\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSihl\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/17101/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/17101/17101.avif\"\n         title=\"Stockwald\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a narrow road snakeing into the distance, with a tall partially wooded cliff taking up the entire background\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"17101\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eStockwald\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/17103/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/17103/17103.avif\"\n         title=\"Melchsee\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a mountainous scene looking down at a lake, streaks of snow partially cover the ground\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"17103\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eMelchsee\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/17105/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/17105/17105.avif\"\n         title=\"Bettenalp\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking down at a cloud inversion in a mountain valley\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"999\"\n\t\t id=\"17105\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eBettenalp\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/17108/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/17108/17108.avif\"\n         title=\"Balconies I\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a section of a 70s apartment building with 4 balconies\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"17108\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eBalconies I\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/17204/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/17204/17204.avif\"\n         title=\"Balconies II\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of an apartment building behind a few trees\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"17204\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eBalconies II\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/17205/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/17205/17205.avif\"\n         title=\"Siedlung Langgrüt\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a dead leaf covered grassy patch with 3 trees in front of an apartment building\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"17205\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSiedlung Langgrüt\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/17304/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/17304/17304.avif\"\n         title=\"Fernsehturm Üetliburg\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a frosty pine forest with a TV tower in the fog in the background\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"17304\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eFernsehturm Üetliburg\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/17306/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/17306/17306.avif\"\n         title=\"Schlittelweg Üetliberg\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a tree with a padded coushin strapped to the base\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"17306\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSchlittelweg Üetliberg\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis year actually came with a change in equipment. I swapped out my Hasselblad\n500C/M for a newer 501C, and with the change gained an 80mm CB lens, which which\nall but one of the above images were taken. I did however stick with the trusty\nIlford HP5+ throughout, all shot at 400 except the last two which were at 800.\u003c/p\u003e",
